# Atlantis III - story segment 01: the Hoggar (world 1, hoggar.wam), new game ->
# arrival in CFuner (world 2) chapter 9.  Read by tools/emu/a3_hoggar_script.py
# (golden evidence/golden/a3_hoggar_script.txt) and by Atlantis Native's replay
# test; grammar in the script's docstring and subsystems/hoggar-walkthrough.md.
# Same actions as a3_hoggar_walk.txt (M2); the chain goes on with a3_story_02_cfuner.txt.
# Only actions the game allows: moves along the current view's WAM zones,
# clicks on characters / zones of the current view, subjects of the open menu,
# bag objects.  Names are defnames.con ids (#PERSONNAGES#, #SUJETS#, #OBJETS#,
# #ZONES_CLIC#).

START                       # chapter 600 -> chapter 1, view 4; cinematics 93, 1, 2
EXPECT CHAPTER=1
EXPECT VUE=4

# Chapter 1: the plateau
GO 5                        # departvue=5: quick save 1
GO 6                        # departvue=6: voice-over dialog 1, flag426
GO 7                        # departvue=7: chapter 2 (the camp)
EXPECT CHAPTER=2

# Chapter 2: guard 1, first talk (subjects enabled by chapter 2's /INIT)
PERSO HOG_GARDIEN01
SUBJECT HOG_G1_SITE         # dialogs 5 and 8, Flag3
# second talk: the guard shoots (cinema 27) and the game reloads quick save 1
PERSO HOG_GARDIEN01
SUBJECT HOG_G1_PUITS        # dialog 6, cinema 27, Load=1
EXPECT CHAPTER=1
EXPECT VUE=4
EXPECT FLAG3=0

# again, after the reload
GO 5                        # quick save 1 again
GO 6                        # dialog 1 again (flag426 was saved as 0)
GO 7                        # chapter 2
GO 10                       # departvue=10: Flag2, chapter 3
EXPECT CHAPTER=3

# Chapter 3: before the cave
GO 11                       # departvue=11, first time: cinema 3, dialog 10, cinema 23; move aborted
EXPECT VUE=10
GO 13
GO 2                        # departvue=2: chapter 4 (the cave)
EXPECT CHAPTER=4

# Chapter 4: the spinning top
GO 1
HAND HOG_OBJ_DISQUE
ZONE HOG_TOUPIE_POSE        # the disc is laid down, flag416
HAND HOG_OBJ_BATON
ZONE HOG_TOUPIE_POSE        # the stick on the disc: the top (HOG_OBJ_TOUPIE) in hand
EXPECT HAND=HOG_OBJ_TOUPIE
# The toupie puzzle (0x004d4160 throws, 0x004d3980 per frame) is C code: its
# success state is injected: the five stars lit (flags 420..424, objects
# HOG_ETOILE01..05 shown); the next frame's 0x004d3980 (real) sees them, sets
# Flag13 and runs the arrival of chapter 4's first section (cinema 4, world 2).
SKIP puzzle toupie FLAG420=1 FLAG421=1 FLAG422=1 FLAG423=1 FLAG424=1 SHOWOBJET=HOG_ETOILE01 SHOWOBJET=HOG_ETOILE02 SHOWOBJET=HOG_ETOILE03 SHOWOBJET=HOG_ETOILE04 SHOWOBJET=HOG_ETOILE05
EXPECT FLAG13=1
EXPECT MONDE=2
EXPECT WAM=CFuner.wam
EXPECT CHAPTER=9
EXPECT VUE=4

CHECKPOINT 101 01_hoggar_end
